OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA noticeably chillier feel
OL,6,Ftoday in a northwesterly breeze,
OL,7,Falthough around average for the time
OL,8,Fof year. Plenty of sunshine on offer
OL,9,Fin-between patchy cloud with perhaps
OL,10,Fthe odd isolated shower around
OL,11,Flunchtime.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA chillier night to come,
OL,14,Fespecially under clearer skies with
OL,15,Flight northerly winds. More in the way
OL,16,Fof cloud with a risk of showers along
OL,17,Fthe west coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
