OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA bright start to Saturday,
OL,6,Fwith prolonged spells of sunshine
OL,7,Flasting throughout. Temperatures
OL,8,Fremaining around average for the time
OL,9,Fof year.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAgain,
OL,12,Fplenty of sunshine on offer to start
OL,13,Fon Sunday, before turning cloudier
OL,14,Fwith some welcome rain through Monday
OL,15,Finto Tuesday.
